{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51795","headline":"鸂鶒 · 王鼎","name":"鸂鶒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"栖息应难近小池，性灵闲雅衆禽希。\n蒲洲日暖依花立，渔浦烟深贴浪飞。\n遗羽参差沾水沫，余踪稠叠印苔衣。\n晚来林径微风起，何处相呼着对归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王鼎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51795.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51795","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}